  "description": "Operating Area: Sardinia, Corsica\n\nDom Pedro is a fifty-foot Pershing 50.1, built for the fast crossing between Sardinia and Corsica and for the long lunch\nonce you arrive. Three cabins sleep six, and a separate crew cabin keeps the boat private. Air conditioning, a generator\nand a premium sound system are all on board, and the cockpit runs from a shaded table forward to a full-beam sunbed\naft.\n",
